  SwissArmyStringArray:
  - Weapon Amplifier
  - Increase Damage of Weapons. Addition Precedes Multiplication. Low Weapon Amplifier
    can Weaken Weapons, but can't Heal the Attack Target.
  - Skill Amplifier
  - Incrase Damage / Shield / Heal of Skill. Addition Precedes Multiplication. Low
    Skill Amplifier can Weaken Skill, but can't Reverse the Skill Result.
  - Defense
  - Decrease Damage toward this Warrior. Multiplication Precedes Addition. Low Armor
    can Increase Damage towraed this Warrior.
  - Damage Dealt
  - Damage this Warrior Has Dealt in this Combat.
  - Damage Taken
  - Damage this Warrior Has Taken in this Combat.
